<title>MEXICO: Mexico May retail sales rise 4.4 percent vs May 96.</title>
<headline>Mexico May retail sales rise 4.4 percent vs May 96.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's retail sales rose 4.4 percent in May compared with the same month in 1996, the National Statistics Institute (INEGI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>INEGI said that wholesale sales in Mexico were at a similar level in May this year to their level of May 1996.</p>
